  "notes": "Play action off pistol_dive (HB Dive, target gap A_R). OL pass-blocks throughout; run-blocking look is cosmetic. RB fakes into A_R selling the run, then settles into his real pass-pro assignment -- A_L, the back-side A gap the Center does not own. Blocks there only if a rusher shows, else releases on the checkdown (Flat). ASSUMPTION-corrected: an earlier pass matched his protection gap to his fake gap (both A_R), duplicating the Center's own assignment; reverted to A_L. Adapted from Levels (single_back_levels): Slot takes H's Flat role since Pistol has no second TE; X's Post still occupies the deep safety, Z's shallow Cross and Y's deeper In still form the two-level read. ASSUMPTION -- source Levels doesn't give the RB a route at all; the checkdown/hot entry is added here as the standard PA mechanic, on top of the original concept.",
